WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.310
<i>Matoi,</i>

00:02.310 --> 00:04.710
<i>I'm going to keep believing in Shiori.</i>

00:04.710 --> 00:07.360
<i>Let's believe in her and wait for her together.</i>

00:08.070 --> 00:09.940
<i>Okay. I believe in her.</i>

00:10.910 --> 00:13.300
So I'll...

00:23.910 --> 00:25.740
Hello?

00:29.300 --> 00:30.760
Again!?

00:30.760 --> 00:32.520
This is the third time this week!

00:32.520 --> 00:35.630
If you would like to fight,
come to the address I've sent you.

00:36.550 --> 00:37.510
Okay.

00:43.050 --> 00:45.810
I've transformed too much lately.
All my clothes are gone!

00:49.510 --> 00:51.000
Yuma-chan!

00:51.440 --> 00:53.970
You're late, Toi-san!
Let's do this thing alrea—

00:53.970 --> 00:54.820
Whoa!?

00:55.310 --> 00:57.670
What's with those clothes!?

00:57.670 --> 00:59.210
Oh, these?

00:59.210 --> 01:01.290
When I transform,
they're going to disappear anyway,

01:01.290 --> 01:03.580
so I put on some clothes I don't need anymore.

01:03.580 --> 01:05.750
Oh, is that what it was?

01:06.080 --> 01:10.890
I thought we were boosting the ratings with some fan service or something.

01:10.890 --> 01:12.710
I have no idea what you're talking about.

01:12.710 --> 01:15.540
Anyway! Let's transform and get down there!

01:15.540 --> 01:16.380
Yeah!

01:18.920 --> 01:20.000
Divine Union!

02:59.410 --> 03:02.390
Another comatose case?

03:02.390 --> 03:05.000
This is the third one this week.

03:10.250 --> 03:13.480
The Exorcist Girls arrive!!

03:10.740 --> 03:13.460
And the Exorcist Girls showed up again, huh?

03:13.970 --> 03:15.610
<i>You may be a police officer,</i>

03:15.610 --> 03:18.210
<i>but this isn't something
ordinary humans can handle.</i>

03:18.720 --> 03:21.590
Even so, do you really think I can sit still and leave it all to you?

03:24.010 --> 03:27.370
Yuma-chan, I can't believe you're still leaving those weird cards.

03:27.370 --> 03:30.990
All the world must know of the exorcist girls!

03:30.990 --> 03:33.460
I stand out enough already.

03:33.460 --> 03:35.000
You two.

03:35.000 --> 03:37.700
While progress has been slow,
you seem to be getting better at this.

03:37.700 --> 03:39.370
For real?

03:39.370 --> 03:43.340
Hearing that from you makes me feel so much more confident, Clarie-san!

03:43.340 --> 03:45.950
Just continue as you have been, please.

03:45.950 --> 03:46.900
Yes, ma'am!

03:46.900 --> 03:49.550
Yuma-chan, let's get back before it gets too late.

03:49.550 --> 03:50.650
Okay!

03:50.650 --> 03:54.710
Well, Clarie-san, call us
if anything happens again.

03:54.710 --> 03:55.920
I will.

04:02.150 --> 04:04.930
Are you going to have those two participate in battle with us?

04:05.310 --> 04:09.990
In the beginning, we assumed the Nights were after Sumeragi Matoi's sacred treasure.

04:10.780 --> 04:11.950
However,

04:11.950 --> 04:14.930
it seems things have changed.

04:14.930 --> 04:16.690
What happened at the sea was different.

04:17.060 --> 04:19.720
It was as if the Nights deliberately planned an attack

04:19.720 --> 04:23.780
in order to test the extent of those girls' powers.

04:25.250 --> 04:27.390
In order to discover what
the Nights might be after now,

04:27.390 --> 04:29.720
we're going to put them on the front lines.

04:30.930 --> 04:32.540
Do you object to this?

04:32.540 --> 04:33.400
No.

04:34.540 --> 04:35.900
I understand.

04:37.580 --> 04:40.670
Nights... What are you plotting?

04:42.030 --> 04:46.900
I don't know what Set is thinking, sending us after these small fry.

04:47.290 --> 04:53.520
We could finish a few little girls with a snap of our fingers.

04:53.790 --> 04:56.230
It'd be best not to underestimate them.

04:56.230 --> 05:00.020
Those "little girls" defeated Phegor.

05:00.880 --> 05:03.280
You think we should keep our guard up?

05:03.890 --> 05:07.500
Be patient. Set will give us instructions soon enough.

05:08.170 --> 05:12.040
After all, we were summoned for a reason.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.250
Thank You.

05:17.040 --> 05:19.420
Come on, folks, step up and buy!

05:17.050 --> 05:20.010
Flea
Market

05:21.260 --> 05:22.260
Wow,

05:22.260 --> 05:24.370
this is cute!

05:24.370 --> 05:26.170
For you, it's 2,000 yen.

05:26.170 --> 05:27.130
Huh? But...

05:27.490 --> 05:29.100
You like it, don't you?

05:29.480 --> 05:31.010
Thank you so—

05:31.350 --> 05:36.380
<i>With the allowance I've saved up and the money
from my shrine maiden job, I only have 8,400 yen.</i>

05:36.380 --> 05:40.670
<i>If I can't buy at least ten more outfits with the money I have,</i>

05:40.670 --> 05:43.900
<i>I won't have anything to wear!</i>

05:44.360 --> 05:47.360
<i>It's so cute! It's so cute, but...</i>

05:49.970 --> 05:50.950
I don't think I—

05:50.950 --> 05:52.540
Here you are.

05:52.540 --> 05:53.930
Thank you!

05:53.930 --> 05:55.590
Shingo-san?

05:55.590 --> 05:57.650
I can do little things like this, can't I?

05:57.650 --> 05:59.080
Or does it bother you?

05:59.710 --> 06:01.970
No. Thank you.

06:04.210 --> 06:05.720
I promise I'll take good care of it.

06:06.970 --> 06:08.470
Y-You do that.

06:10.600 --> 06:14.500
You certainly bought a lot of plain,
cheap clothes, didn't you?

06:14.500 --> 06:17.010
I'm going to use them all as loungewear.

06:17.010 --> 06:20.340
And you bought me something nice, too.

06:20.340 --> 06:22.650
Well, I guess that's all right.

06:25.150 --> 06:28.050
Shingo-san, don't you have to go to work?

06:28.050 --> 06:31.640
Seems like the Exorcist Girls are taking care of everything.

06:32.400 --> 06:35.810
I'll leave Poochi to handle all the details.

06:39.920 --> 06:43.460
It's my first day off in a while,
so I'm going to take it easy.

06:43.460 --> 06:44.690
That's good.

06:44.690 --> 06:48.500
Even busy police officers need a break sometimes.

06:48.970 --> 06:50.420
Exactly.

06:54.230 --> 06:55.850
It's such a nice day.

06:58.830 --> 07:00.570
It's probably going to be hot later.

07:00.570 --> 07:02.730
The weatherman said it's a true summer day.

07:06.640 --> 07:08.040
That just means hot!

07:08.040 --> 07:08.960
Yeah.

07:17.950 --> 07:20.710
<i>I... I can't think of anything else to talk about!</i>

07:26.510 --> 07:27.600
What's going on?

07:28.050 --> 07:29.330
My apologies.

07:29.330 --> 07:31.380
It looks like Set has selected me for this task.

07:31.740 --> 07:32.920
I'll be going on ahead.

07:37.240 --> 07:39.390
So I'm left behind?

07:41.610 --> 07:43.410
Luciela-sensei?

07:43.410 --> 07:46.020
Are we really meeting him here?

07:46.420 --> 07:48.620
I don't think I have the wrong place...

07:52.820 --> 07:53.910
I've kept you waiting.

07:53.910 --> 07:56.400
What's with this sudden meeting?

07:56.880 --> 07:59.160
And at a place like this, too!

08:00.250 --> 08:03.090
Clarus has been spotted many times while in Divine Union.

08:03.090 --> 08:05.040
It's become difficult to remain in this city.

08:05.850 --> 08:08.790
I would like to open a line of
communication with the IATO

08:08.790 --> 08:11.300
to discuss the frequency and
locations of the Nights' appearances.

08:12.860 --> 08:14.470
Well...

08:14.470 --> 08:17.440
Indeed. I have no objections.

08:17.440 --> 08:19.630
I thought you would agree.

08:19.630 --> 08:21.820
Let's discuss the details inside.

08:21.820 --> 08:23.320
Y-You must be joking!

08:23.320 --> 08:24.690
You want me to go in there with you?

08:25.210 --> 08:27.220
I never joke.

08:27.220 --> 08:29.820
I-I think you're skipping a few steps!

08:30.520 --> 08:32.220
I've followed the proper procedure.

08:32.220 --> 08:33.570
Is there a problem?

08:33.810 --> 08:35.600
The problem is...

08:39.430 --> 08:40.700
The girl will also accompany us.

08:42.200 --> 08:44.360
The more there are, the better.

08:44.360 --> 08:46.290
Clarus is waiting inside as well.

08:47.410 --> 08:49.740
What is it? Are you not coming?

08:49.740 --> 08:51.510
You pervert!

08:54.330 --> 08:56.930
I'm glad you could come, Azuma-sama.

08:58.770 --> 09:00.240
Azuma-sama.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.440
Azu...

09:08.440 --> 09:09.980
Yes?

09:10.410 --> 09:11.730
I'll say this first:

09:11.730 --> 09:15.870
I've already reported everything that happened at Tenkai Shrine. I have nothing to add.

09:15.870 --> 09:17.720
It's not that.

09:17.720 --> 09:21.120
There was something
I wanted to ask you, er... Azu,

09:21.120 --> 09:24.050
about the girl who was cradling the Maiden of the Sea.

09:24.050 --> 09:27.250
I see. Sumeragi Matoi?

09:27.730 --> 09:33.260
I'm already aware that she has the potential to open the door to the highest dimension.

09:33.850 --> 09:35.410
The issue is...

09:35.410 --> 09:39.580
When to tell her about Shiori, right?

09:39.580 --> 09:40.650
Indeed.

09:40.650 --> 09:42.340
When she learns the truth,

09:42.340 --> 09:46.020
Matoi will likely act without
considering the consequences.

09:46.850 --> 09:48.480
She's such a straightforward girl.

09:49.290 --> 09:51.360
Just like Shiori.

09:54.400 --> 09:56.780
We don't have to eat here.

09:56.780 --> 09:58.910
It's such a waste of money.

09:58.910 --> 10:00.120
We can splurge sometimes, right?

10:01.870 --> 10:04.410
Awfully lifeless for the summer holidays.

10:04.410 --> 10:06.210
Is this place doing okay?

10:06.210 --> 10:08.420
My. I think it's lovely up here.

10:11.790 --> 10:13.880
Plenty of time to enjoy your meal.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.240
You're—

10:16.060 --> 10:16.810
Matoi, get behind—

10:16.810 --> 10:18.000
Run.

10:18.810 --> 10:20.190
Y-You're...

10:20.190 --> 10:21.350
Where's Matoi?

10:21.350 --> 10:23.730
I've already escorted her out of the tower.

10:23.730 --> 10:24.460
How?

10:24.460 --> 10:26.870
Let's worry about getting you out of here first.

10:27.690 --> 10:30.350
Don't tell me that woman is a demon?

10:30.350 --> 10:32.470
Yes. The demon is possessing her.

10:32.470 --> 10:35.850
Set, you naughty thing.
Giving me all of these impossible orders.

10:41.910 --> 10:43.170
Prepare yourselves.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.210
A blizzard!?

10:48.210 --> 10:50.850
I-Is this another one of the demon's tricks?

10:57.210 --> 11:00.680
I'm freezing...

11:01.950 --> 11:06.100
To think that the hotel was
such a den of iniquity...

11:06.320 --> 11:10.100
Lord, please forgive your sinful servant!

11:10.440 --> 11:12.990
You're just lucky no one called the police on you two.

11:12.990 --> 11:14.050
What do you mean?

11:14.970 --> 11:16.600
Never mind.

11:18.640 --> 11:19.600
A DR reaction!?

11:19.600 --> 11:20.500
What?

11:20.780 --> 11:22.290
Damn it...

11:22.790 --> 11:25.240
What are you planning on doing with us?

11:25.240 --> 11:26.830
The two of you...

11:32.870 --> 11:35.410
can no longer escape!

11:43.510 --> 11:44.690
Damn!

11:44.690 --> 11:48.110
How can I not get cell signal so high up?

11:56.370 --> 11:59.410
No good. It's frozen over and won't move.

12:01.390 --> 12:03.810
And the temperature just keeps dropping!

12:03.810 --> 12:05.150
I'll figure something out.

12:05.670 --> 12:08.030
<i>I should be able to escape
through a higher dimension.</i>

12:14.600 --> 12:16.230
Ow.

12:16.230 --> 12:18.160
A-Are you okay?

12:18.160 --> 12:19.330
Yeah.

12:19.330 --> 12:21.380
Looks like it's not just ice around us.

12:21.380 --> 12:24.470
There's some kind of demonic barrier keeping us in.

12:25.110 --> 12:26.960
What should we do?

12:26.960 --> 12:28.880
I'll try using my power.

12:30.090 --> 12:32.420
<i>I'll call on the power of my god...</i>

12:48.490 --> 12:49.490
This is...

12:54.700 --> 12:56.170
I-It's no use.

12:56.170 --> 12:58.350
The barrier is blocking me.

12:59.270 --> 13:00.870
There's no way out!?

13:10.140 --> 13:10.930
Clarus!

13:10.930 --> 13:12.210
Roger.

13:12.210 --> 13:13.790
I'm coming too!

13:20.640 --> 13:21.580
Come.

13:26.340 --> 13:28.690
Photogenic Plasma Illusion!

13:35.530 --> 13:37.140
Divine Union!

13:38.710 --> 13:40.950
We'll use higher dimensional
spaces to get up there.

13:40.950 --> 13:41.930
Okay!

13:47.620 --> 13:48.550
We bounced off!?

13:48.550 --> 13:50.880
They erected a bulwark around the tower.

13:50.880 --> 13:52.010
Then...

13:53.260 --> 13:54.570
We'll force our way in!

13:54.570 --> 13:55.800
We're breaking through!

13:56.800 --> 13:57.850
It's tough!

13:58.680 --> 14:01.770
No way! There's <i>no way</i>
my attack wouldn't work!

14:02.570 --> 14:04.170
You can't get inside?

14:04.170 --> 14:05.650
The Nights have erected a barrier.

14:05.650 --> 14:08.100
We can't enter from higher dimensional spaces either.

14:08.100 --> 14:10.120
Do you know what conditions are like on the observation deck?

14:10.120 --> 14:12.400
The temperature is dropping at an extreme rate.

14:12.400 --> 14:14.240
By now, it's likely below freezing.

14:14.610 --> 14:16.950
Why would the Nights do this?

14:17.930 --> 14:20.370
Yuma, where's Matoi today?

14:20.590 --> 14:22.250
<i>It's like the Nights deliberately planned an attack...</i>

14:22.250 --> 14:23.670
Toi-san?

14:23.670 --> 14:28.130
She said she and her dad were going to the flea market in Kamagaya Park.

14:28.130 --> 14:29.380
It can't be.

14:30.290 --> 14:33.830
Do you think Matoi and Sergeant Sumeragi are trapped in the observation deck?

14:41.400 --> 14:42.500
Shit.

14:42.500 --> 14:45.400
I'm so cold, I can barely move!

14:46.220 --> 14:50.270
Aren't you cold in that outfit?

14:51.540 --> 14:55.000
Or are your powers keeping you warm?

14:56.900 --> 14:58.350
What? Oh no!

14:58.350 --> 14:59.330
What's wrong?

14:59.730 --> 15:02.080
Don't look over here! Look over there instead!

15:02.810 --> 15:04.180
Just do it!

15:04.180 --> 15:06.300
Wh-What is it?

15:06.300 --> 15:06.960
What's going...

15:06.960 --> 15:09.170
Why is this happening?

15:10.060 --> 15:11.120
Wait!

15:11.120 --> 15:13.550
Ah, oh no!

15:13.550 --> 15:14.800
Hey, what's going—

15:14.800 --> 15:16.020
Don't look over here!

15:16.020 --> 15:18.500
Don't you even, even dare!

15:18.500 --> 15:20.400
A-All right.

15:24.600 --> 15:27.290
<i>This has happened to me before...</i>

15:29.080 --> 15:30.550
<i>Don't you dare look over here!</i>

15:30.550 --> 15:32.640
<i>O-Okay, okay.</i>

15:44.310 --> 15:45.600
Are you all right?

15:47.600 --> 15:49.200
Just stay with me!

15:49.550 --> 15:52.550
I-I'm fine.

15:52.550 --> 15:55.590
You think I'm going to kick the bucket here?

15:58.070 --> 15:59.220
I have to wait with my daughter...

16:00.230 --> 16:02.510
for my wife to...

16:03.130 --> 16:04.500
Shingo-san...

16:13.220 --> 16:14.440
<i>No!</i>

16:14.440 --> 16:16.970
<i>At this rate, Shingo-san will...</i>

16:16.970 --> 16:18.280
<i>Shingo-san will...</i>

16:23.990 --> 16:25.580
<i>It can't be...</i>

16:29.620 --> 16:30.640
That's...

16:34.700 --> 16:36.620
Clarus-san! Yuma-chan!

16:36.620 --> 16:38.290
Clarus, what's the situation?

16:38.290 --> 16:42.090
Confirmed visual of Sumeragi Matoi on the observation deck.

16:42.090 --> 16:43.580
It looks like her father is with her as well.

16:43.580 --> 16:47.100
Toi-san, you can't get out?

16:50.800 --> 16:53.550
You can't call any weapons or anything?

16:55.860 --> 16:59.400
The barrier is keeping her from using the power of the Myriads?

16:59.400 --> 17:01.720
It's below freezing in the observation tower.

17:01.720 --> 17:04.120
If we don't get them out soon, they'll...

17:04.630 --> 17:06.310
I know.

17:06.310 --> 17:07.930
If we can penetrate the barrier,

17:07.930 --> 17:11.140
she should be able to summon the Myriads through the gap.

17:11.710 --> 17:16.070
But since attacks from out here are ineffective, our options are limited.

17:16.070 --> 17:17.920
There is one way.

17:18.630 --> 17:19.250
What is it?

17:19.250 --> 17:20.260
Give me permission to try it.

17:23.510 --> 17:25.260
Granted. Give it a shot.

17:25.260 --> 17:26.400
Roger.

17:26.400 --> 17:28.520
I'll need your help.

17:28.520 --> 17:31.270
I'll do anything to save Toi-san!

17:31.270 --> 17:33.410
Go into the defense form of your Union.

17:33.410 --> 17:34.520
Okay!

17:36.830 --> 17:40.510
Now switch into your
Total Defense form, and sit over there.

17:43.390 --> 17:44.620
Like this?

17:44.620 --> 17:45.640
Yes.

17:55.570 --> 17:58.050
Output Level: Maximum.

17:59.260 --> 18:00.880
What do I do now?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.840
This!

18:10.290 --> 18:11.390
That's reckless!

18:13.740 --> 18:15.160
Yuma-chan...

18:20.990 --> 18:23.700
Please, do your best.

18:24.330 --> 18:25.200
Please!

18:33.900 --> 18:35.500
It's no good. They can't break through.

18:36.250 --> 18:38.470
Clarus! Go into Burst Mode!

18:38.470 --> 18:39.890
Roger!

18:39.890 --> 18:40.960
Burst Mode!

18:40.960 --> 18:43.250
Unlocked synchronization system.

18:43.250 --> 18:45.120
Status: Burst Mode.

18:51.080 --> 18:52.430
Go!

19:00.320 --> 19:01.300
<i>More!</i>

19:04.810 --> 19:05.900
It's not enough!

19:11.100 --> 19:12.290
Let's do this!

19:16.330 --> 19:17.810
Yuma-chan.

19:19.440 --> 19:22.800
My barrier is being worn away?

19:23.260 --> 19:24.380
That power is—

19:24.380 --> 19:25.210
A Night!

19:25.210 --> 19:26.300
Out of my way!

19:28.050 --> 19:29.130
That's...

19:39.660 --> 19:42.570
Th-That's what you get...

19:42.570 --> 19:43.900
Shingo-san!

19:46.830 --> 19:48.790
The barrier's weakening.

19:48.790 --> 19:49.740
With this...

19:50.200 --> 19:52.280
I can break through!

20:10.610 --> 20:11.930
You did well.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.340
Yuma-chan!

20:16.340 --> 20:19.100
G-Get'em, Toi-san...

20:35.260 --> 20:37.000
They're gathering.

20:37.430 --> 20:39.170
The lights of all the gods...

20:58.230 --> 20:59.540
<i>Thank you.</i>

20:59.540 --> 21:02.100
<i>Clarus-san. Yuma-chan.</i>

21:02.100 --> 21:05.170
<i>We need to get Shingo-san to the hospital now.</i>

21:06.790 --> 21:08.900
This body is useless now.

21:09.790 --> 21:10.770
I need another...

21:11.610 --> 21:13.950
A different vessel!

21:16.350 --> 21:17.500
Shingo-san!

21:23.350 --> 21:24.340
No!

21:24.340 --> 21:27.640
Someone, stop this!

21:27.640 --> 21:30.570
Someone, please, save Shingo-san!

21:31.350 --> 21:32.560
Luck

21:38.280 --> 21:39.810
Stop!

21:52.750 --> 21:54.270
Mom!

21:56.920 --> 21:59.080
Feeling your heart

21:59.080 --> 22:07.840
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

21:59.080 --> 22:07.840
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:07.840 --> 22:13.850
matoi tsuzukeru

22:07.840 --> 22:13.850
by light and shadow

22:13.850 --> 22:17.350
The lonely one

22:19.520 --> 22:21.560
Feeling your heart

22:21.560 --> 22:30.280
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:21.610 --> 22:30.320
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

22:30.280 --> 22:36.540
sore ga shiawase nano

22:30.280 --> 22:36.540
But is that truly happiness?

22:36.540 --> 22:41.500
darekaga egao nara

22:36.540 --> 22:41.500
If someone is smiling,

22:41.500 --> 22:48.010
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

22:41.500 --> 22:48.010
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

22:48.010 --> 22:54.220
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

22:48.010 --> 22:54.220
As our paths continue to cross,

22:54.220 --> 22:59.020
kimochi ga aru

22:54.220 --> 22:59.020
our love grows stronger

22:59.020 --> 23:04.020
hitotoki no aida ni

22:59.020 --> 23:04.020
In that short span of time

23:04.020 --> 23:10.530
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:04.020 --> 23:10.530
we embrace all contradictions

23:10.530 --> 23:18.660
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:10.570 --> 23:18.710
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:18.660 --> 23:23.840
aruiteku no kana

23:18.660 --> 23:23.840
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:26.560 --> 23:29.800
Shingo-san, hang on, Shingo-san!

23:32.380 --> 23:34.260
M-Matoi...

23:34.470 --> 23:35.900
I'm glad.

23:35.900 --> 23:39.370
Mom really was an exorcist girl.

23:39.370 --> 23:41.270
It was like you said.

23:41.270 --> 23:43.650
She never lied to us.

23:44.200 --> 23:46.970
She watched over us.

23:46.970 --> 23:48.600
She protected us.

23:49.380 --> 23:50.600
Mom...

23:51.450 --> 23:52.780
thank you so much.

23:57.210 --> 23:59.300
The dimensional traps continue,

23:59.300 --> 24:01.450
and I hear about my mother's past and her deep resolve.

24:01.450 --> 24:05.370
And the future is left in my hands.

24:05.370 --> 24:07.660
Next time, "The Open Gate."

24:05.410 --> 24:11.130
Episode 10

24:05.410 --> 24:11.130
The Open Gate

24:07.660 --> 24:09.040
Even if fate has already decided,

24:09.040 --> 24:11.130
my wish won't change.
